From d8626087d646a86b7b8e26432242c7f4614d40f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wayne Maurer <wmaurer@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:36:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] wip(foldkit): prototype Definition.produceBlock for Ui

Prototype for #1737 on the slow baseline 65d1cd9c. produceBlock takes
an unconstrained producer thunk, so reading the completed Block's Model
types only the Definition. Other members are read from the producer on
demand. UiBlock is the only consumer.
---
 packages/foldkit/src/block/define.ts   | 11 ++-
 packages/foldkit/src/block/produced.ts | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 packages/foldkit/src/block/public.ts   |  7 ++
 packages/website/src/page/ui/block.ts  | 13 ++--
 4 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/foldkit/src/block/produced.ts

